 "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked, and both reservations show as confirmed.\n\n- **Flight F100 (reservation R0001):** Nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight was available but had a stop.\n- **Hotel: Midtown Lodge, New York (reservation R0002):** Check in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. Manager approval wasn't needed because it's under the $1,000 limit.\n\nThe flight and hotel ended up as two separate bookings, not one combined booking. I tried to book them together, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. Retrying the combined booking could have charged for the flight twice, so I booked the hotel on its own. Dana has exactly one flight and one hotel, with no duplicate charges.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017be8SiuHoDh36Y4LBednDM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019RNVXNdk8w17NXj7EM3sPN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018oCiBDiQyf4DbW6BgfaZMv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Qs3rfcbo54rcikM1TtbWk1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "